          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamazaza nindi, Tiyenu, kwakenza ifuku dakadikita neyi kesi kamuluteŋi; niadinka wanta ejima, niakoŋaŋa yatama ejima, akekala neyi ntotu. Odu ifuku dakenza dakayishita bwi-i, hidakayishiyila hela muji hela mutayuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mwatiyaloŋa ijina dami woma, itaŋwa dakuloŋa dikweti kuuka mumpuula jadu dakayituntukila; mwakedika hanzi nakukiloka neyi anyana kaŋombi amwitaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakadatola atama, akekala neyi mawuti mwishina damadachilu enu, mwifuku dinakakoŋa chumichi. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova wamazaza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
